project_id: "003"
proposer: "fiscalhost1"
title: "For Schools, With Love: by the kids, for the kids"
desc: """
  Join us students from the State of Kerala, as we say thanks to the creators of
  FunPlay - an incredible piece of software that we use everyday at school.

  Many of us had a discussion with the maintainer of the project about enhancements
  required for our school. It turned out we could ourselves do the required changes.
  The maintainer has kindly consented to guide us students in this, with assistance
  from some of our teachers. We are looking forward to the day when our school could
  potentially be running the software that we wrote, in atleast some small way! Our
  teachers tell us that there is no reason for other schools not to find this useful,
  but we are telling ourselves - one step at a time.

  The changes would require not only volunteer bandwidth, but also support logistics
  - travel, stay and multimedia recordings in studios for best quality. We already
  have a project plan drafted for this, accessible on our project page. This is a
  multi-phase project. We are seeking funds for Phase I right now.

  We are running this funding campaign to spread the awareness of the benefits of
  Free and Open Source Software by giving back in many different ways.

  Join us to say Thank you! Not limited to "Gods Own Country"... Gods from other
  countries are welcome too :) Help us expand the reach of FOSS in schools beyond Kerala.

  We have been looking for generous donors. Through an uncle, we were forunate enought to
  reach out to Gadinadu Kannadigara Sangha, Kasaragod. They were surprised to know that
  such a fund existed. They have also kindly agreed to match the grants raised by us through
  our campaign on The Rupee Fund. Due to this, we need to raise much less than we would
  have to otherwise.
"""
funding_range:: 75000, 125000
campaign_url: "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=project-campaign-video-id"
categories:: "short-term", "nascent"
licenses:: "MIT", "CC-BY-SA-4.0"
deliverables::
  - ::
    licenses: "CC-BY-SA-4.0"
    desc: """
      Multimedia recording database. Sounds of local birds, vehicles, objects,
      voice clips suitable for fun classroom exercises. Similarly, many many
      hours of video edited by us.
    ""
  - ::
    licenses: "GPL-V3.0"
    desc: """
      Our patches merged upstream into FunPlay. The functionality we help
      co-create will become available for all schools to use and customize
      as needed.
    ""
matching_grants::
  - ::
    uid: "mgid1"
    matching_ratio:: 1,1
    funding_range:: 75000, 125000
members::
  - ::
    # Student
    uid: "uid4"
    role: """
      Media editor/interaction design/documentation etc
    """
  - ::
    # Student
    uid: "uid5"
    role: """
      Lead campaigner. Came up with the idea that The Rupee Fund is the
      appropriate platform for this campaign.
    """
  - ::
    # Guide
    uid: "uid6"
    role: """
      Serves as project guide. Facilitates interaction with the developer,
      manages finances and interaction with authorities at the school and
      higher levels.
    """
    fund_usage: """
      Training, Travel, Stay, High Quality recordings as detailed in Phase I
      document.
    """
